msgid "Nexus 0.1.0 Source SDK developer preview"
msgstr "Nexus 0.1.0 Source SDK 开发者预览版"

msgid ""
"Nexus 0.1.0 is the first public platform Source SDK developer preview, "
"dated 2026-10-15 (Asia/Shanghai). Use this page to check its software "
"scope, required inputs and release evidence before integrating a "
"consumer. Every MCU physical HIL result remains `not_executed`."
msgstr ""
"Nexus 0.1.0 是首个公开的平台 Source SDK 开发者预览版，日期为 "
"2026-10-15（Asia/Shanghai）。接入消费工程前，请使用本页核对软件范围、必需输入和发行证据。所有 MCU 实板 HIL "
"结果仍为 `not_executed`。"

msgid "Source and compatibility"
msgstr "源码与兼容性"

msgid ""
"The release asset inventory and SDK manifest identify the actual "
"released commit/tree and bytes. Documentation packages independently "
"record their `documentation_source`, `code_source` and historical "
"`qualified_code`; publication does not transfer old software "
"qualification to a new source. See [software "
"verification](software-verification.md) for those identity rules."
msgstr ""
"发行资产清单和 SDK manifest 标识实际发布的 commit／tree 与字节。文档包独立记录 "
"`documentation_source`、`code_source` 和历史 "
"`qualified_code`；发布不会把旧软件资格转移到新源码。这些身份规则见[软件验证](software-verification.md)。"

msgid ""
"`dependencies/platform-compatibility.json` is the sole authored "
"semantic-version policy. CMake, generated headers and installed package "
"metadata derive `0.1.0` from it. Consumers request `find_package(Nexus "
"0.1.0 EXACT CONFIG REQUIRED)`. Source interface epoch `1`, authored TOML"
" schema `2` and exact source-only SDK matching remain separate, "
"unchanged contracts. The SDK promises no stable binary ABI; compile the "
"platform, generated bindings and consumer under the same configuration, "
"compiler and ABI choices."
msgstr ""
"`dependencies/platform-compatibility.json` "
"是唯一人工维护的语义版本策略。CMake、生成头文件和已安装包元数据从中派生 `0.1.0`。消费方请求 `find_package(Nexus"
" 0.1.0 EXACT CONFIG REQUIRED)`。源码接口 epoch `1`、authored TOML schema `2` "
"和仅源码 SDK 的精确匹配保持各自独立且不变的合同。SDK 不承诺稳定二进制 ABI；平台、生成 bindings "
"和消费工程须使用相同的配置、编译器与 ABI 选择编译。"

msgid ""
"Prepublication source snapshots used `1.0.0`. They keep their historical"
" source identities and do not become 0.1.0 packages. The 2026-01-12 "
"Phase 1 changelog entry is an early development milestone; no "
"corresponding public platform GitHub tag/release was observed in the "
"2026-10-15 release inventory."
msgstr ""
"公开发行前的源码快照使用 `1.0.0`。它们保留历史源码身份，不会变成 0.1.0 包。2026-01-12 "
"的第一阶段更新日志是早期开发里程碑；2026-10-15 发行盘点时未观察到对应的公开平台 GitHub tag／release。"

msgid "Maintained software scope"
msgstr "维护的软件范围"

msgid "Platform"
msgstr "平台"

msgid "Explicit backend scope"
msgstr "明确的后端范围"

msgid "Reference boundary"
msgstr "参考边界"

msgid "Native"
msgstr "Native"

msgid "Native, ThreadX"
msgstr "Native、ThreadX"

msgid "Linux/POSIX models and selected real host kernel paths"
msgstr "Linux/POSIX 模型和选定的真实 host 内核路径"

msgid "F407ZG Qiming, F407VE Sky, F470ZG Liangshan"
msgstr "F407ZG 启明、F407VE 天空星、F470ZG 梁山派"

msgid "Baremetal, FreeRTOS, ThreadX"
msgstr "裸机、FreeRTOS、ThreadX"

msgid "Exact three initial Board assemblies and their maintained modes"
msgstr "精确的三块首发 Board 装配及其维护模式"

msgid "G474 MB1367 source reference"
msgstr "G474 MB1367 来源参考"

msgid "Baremetal, FreeRTOS"
msgstr "裸机、FreeRTOS"

msgid ""
"Fixed HSE24/170 MHz, TIM2, GPIO, IRQ LPUART and selected EXTI fixtures"
msgstr "固定 HSE24/170 MHz、TIM2、GPIO、IRQ LPUART 和选定 EXTI 夹具"

msgid "H743 NUCLEO source reference"
msgstr "H743 NUCLEO 来源参考"

msgid ""
"Fixed HSI32/64 and cache profiles; GPIO, TIM2, IRQ UART and finite TX "
"DMA"
msgstr "固定 HSI32/64 与 Cache 配置；GPIO、TIM2、IRQ UART 和有限 TX DMA"

msgid "U575 single-world NUCLEO source reference"
msgstr "U575 单域 NUCLEO 来源参考"

msgid "Preconfigured TZEN=0/SWAP_BANK=0, MSIS4, GPIO, TIM2 and IRQ UART"
msgstr "预先配置 TZEN=0/SWAP_BANK=0、MSIS4、GPIO、TIM2 和 IRQ UART"

msgid "Separate U575 paired-world Runtime reference"
msgstr "独立的 U575 双域 Runtime 参考"

msgid "No OS"
msgstr "无 OS"

msgid ""
"Fixed TZEN=1 attribution and bounded synchronous copied GPIO messages"
msgstr "固定 TZEN=1 归属和有界同步复制 GPIO 消息"

msgid ""
"The [exact support record](../delivery/support.md) and [derived "
"capability matrix](../delivery/capabilities.md) remain authoritative for"
" part numbers, routes, controller modes and unknown Board facts. H743 RX"
" DMA, runtime frequency switching, deep STOP with continuous time and "
"general U575 dual-domain factory/NS RTOS/asynchronous loans are outside "
"this preview's implemented references. G474's M4 does not authorize a "
"ThreadX Board backend."
msgstr ""
"[精确支持记录](../delivery/support.md)和[派生能力矩阵](../delivery/capabilities.md)仍是料号、路线、控制器模式和未知"
" Board 事实的权威。H743 RX DMA、运行中调频、保持连续计时的深 STOP，以及通用 U575 双域 factory／NS "
"RTOS／异步借用均不属于本预览版已实现的参考范围。G474 的 M4 不授权 ThreadX Board 后端。"

msgid ""
"CPU-only Runtime covers M0/M0+/M3/M4/M7/M23/M33/M55/M85 software "
"profiles without creating SoC, Board, startup, routes, linker layouts or"
" factories. Baremetal and FreeRTOS profile coverage does not expand the "
"Native/M4 ThreadX subset. See the [CPU support "
"contract](../delivery/cortex-m.md)."
msgstr ""
"CPU-only Runtime 覆盖 M0/M0+/M3/M4/M7/M23/M33/M55/M85 软件 profile，不创建 "
"SoC、Board、启动、路线、链接布局或 factory。裸机和 FreeRTOS 的 profile 覆盖范围不扩大 Native／M4 "
"ThreadX 子集。详见 [CPU 支持合同](../delivery/cortex-m.md)。"

msgid "Required package and tool inputs"
msgstr "必需的包与工具输入"

msgid ""
"Use a clean committed source SDK with its full pinned recursive "
"dependency, reviewed import and license/notice closure. Its "
"`.nexus-source-sdk.json` records the source commit/tree, dependency "
"identities, complete file hashes and exported CMake package hashes. A "
"dirty `--development-fixture` is nonpublishable."
msgstr ""
"使用干净且已提交的源码 SDK，并包含完整固定递归依赖、已审查厂商导入和许可／notice 闭包。其 "
"`.nexus-source-sdk.json` 记录源码 commit／tree、依赖身份、完整文件哈希和导出的 CMake "
"包哈希。脏工作树的 `--development-fixture` 不可发布。"

msgid ""
"The maintained software delivery path uses Linux x86_64. Read the "
"release's actual tool-version and command receipts for the executed "
"Python, CMake, Ninja, Native compiler, GNU Arm distribution and any OCI "
"identity. Declared minimum versions and lock files alone do not prove "
"installation, consumer execution or offline reproduction. CP311 offline "
"installation and Windows/macOS integrated execution are not established "
"by the older Linux/CP312 evidence."
msgstr ""
"维护的软件交付路径使用 Linux x86_64。请阅读本次发行实际的工具版本和命令 receipt，确认所执行的 "
"Python、CMake、Ninja、Native 编译器、GNU Arm 发行物和任何 OCI "
"身份。仅有最低版本声明和锁文件不能证明安装、消费工程执行或离线复现。较早的 Linux／CP312 证据不建立 CP311 离线安装或 "
"Windows/macOS 集成执行。"

msgid ""
"From a checkout, use the [source setup "
"guide](../guides/source-checkout.md). For an installed prefix, follow "
"the [relocated SDK tutorial](../tutorials/source-sdk.md) and the "
"package's maintained verification commands. Consumer configuration must "
"reject a changed manifest, wrong source pin, different exact version or "
"invalid assembly rather than silently selecting another Board or mode."
msgstr ""
"从 checkout 开始时，使用[源码设置指南](../guides/source-checkout.md)。对于已安装前缀，遵循[搬移后 "
"SDK 教程](../tutorials/source-sdk.md)及包内维护的核验命令。消费工程配置必须拒绝已变更的 "
"manifest、错误源码 pin、不同的精确版本或无效装配，不能静默选择另一块 Board 或其他模式。"

msgid "Verify the released bytes and actual results"
msgstr "核验发行字节与实际结果"

msgid ""
"Read the release asset inventory, preserve the published archive size "
"and SHA-256, and verify the downloaded archive before unpacking it into "
"a new directory. Retain the immutable source and asset locations with "
"those hashes."
msgstr "阅读发行资产清单，保留公开归档的大小和 SHA-256，并在解包至新目录前核验下载归档。保留这些哈希以及不可变源码和资产位置。"

msgid ""
"Run the SDK's whole-manifest verifier and actual independent relocated "
"consumers against that exact prefix. Inspect their recorded argv, exits "
"and raw logs. Native execution and ARM link/resource checks establish "
"separate scopes; missing tools, empty reports and skipped-only results "
"do not pass."
msgstr ""
"针对该精确前缀执行 SDK 的完整 manifest 核验器和真正独立、搬移后的消费工程。检查记录的 argv、退出码和原始日志。Native "
"执行与 ARM 链接／资源检查分别建立范围；缺少工具、空报告或仅跳过的结果均不能通过。"

msgid ""
"Match the source, configuration, dependencies, executed tools and "
"artifact hashes to each qualification claim. If reference firmware is "
"supplied, inspect its exact ELF/BIN/map and resource records. Claim "
"offline reproducibility only for two actual fresh network-disabled "
"builds of the same bound inputs."
msgstr ""
"将源码、配置、依赖、实际执行的工具与产物哈希逐一对应到资格声明。若提供参考固件，检查其精确 ELF／BIN／map "
"和资源记录。只有针对相同绑定输入实际执行两次全新断网构建，才能声明离线可复现。"

msgid ""
"Read the actual provenance bundle and its subject identity when "
"supplied. File digests detect changed bytes; an unsigned checksum is not"
" publisher authentication or a product-release signature."
msgstr ""
"若提供 provenance bundle，阅读实际 bundle 及其 subject "
"身份。文件摘要检测字节变化；无签名校验和不构成发布者认证或产品发行签名。"

msgid ""
"Keep physical acceptance separate. Software models, ARM linking, SDK "
"consumers and documentation publication do not observe Board wiring, "
"power, silicon revision, clock accuracy, IRQ/DMA timing, cache coherence"
" or TrustZone isolation."
msgstr ""
"物理验收须独立进行。软件模型、ARM 链接、SDK 消费工程和文档发布不会观察 Board 接线、供电、硅片修订、时钟精度、IRQ/DMA "
"时序、Cache 一致性或 TrustZone 隔离。"

msgid ""
"These are verification requirements, not invented execution receipts. "
"The release's actual result files determine which software scopes "
"executed. Existing failed attempts and historical source IDs remain "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"这些是核验要求，不是编造的执行 receipt。本次发行的实际结果文件决定哪些软件范围已执行。已有失败尝试和历史源码 ID 保持不变。"

msgid "Historical candidate availability and remaining acceptance"
msgstr "历史候选可取得性与剩余验收"

msgid ""
"The formal build-system baseline remains `cc6a065c`; earlier SoC "
"baselines are separate. Its eight unsigned H743/U575 candidates select "
"only HSI64/cache off or MSIS4/TZEN=0, empty/IRQ-UART and "
"baremetal/FreeRTOS. They do not qualify this new release source or the "
"broader cache/DMA/paired-world fixtures."
msgstr ""
"正式构建系统基线仍为 `cc6a065c`；较早 SoC 基线独立记录。其八个无签名 H743／U575 候选只选择 HSI64／Cache "
"off 或 MSIS4／TZEN=0、empty／IRQ-UART 以及裸机／FreeRTOS。它们不使本次新发行源码或更广的 "
"Cache／DMA／双域夹具获得资格。"

msgid ""
"On 2026-10-15, all eight candidate archives were unavailable at the "
"paths in the {download}`original result index "
"<../delivery/build-system-results.json>`. Their `candidate-archives` "
"directory was a symlink into the absent relocated "
"`/tmp/nexus-docs-polish-20261014/relocated-historical-cache/candidate-archives`."
" Historical archive-verification receipts remain evidence of their "
"original execution; they do not make the archive bytes currently "
"available. The original indices have not been rewritten. Recover and "
"reverify byte-identical copies before offering those historical archives"
" as downloadable release assets."
msgstr ""
"2026-10-15，八个候选归档在{download}`原始结果索引 "
"<../delivery/build-system-results.json>`记录的路径均不可取得。其 "
"`candidate-archives` 目录是指向不存在的搬移路径 "
"`/tmp/nexus-docs-polish-20261014/relocated-historical-cache/candidate-archives`"
" 的符号链接。历史归档核验 receipt "
"仍是原执行的证据，但不会使归档字节当前可取得。原索引未被改写。将这些历史归档作为可下载发行资产提供前，须恢复并重新核验逐字节相同的副本。"

msgid ""
"The baseline's complete 72-stage single invocation, OCI recipe "
"reconstruction, CP311 offline installation, Windows/macOS integration "
"and external-example upgrade remain unexecuted in that record. A clearly"
" bounded source preview can retain those limits. Source/interface "
"changes still need their applicable fresh software checks; old test "
"counts cannot substitute for them."
msgstr ""
"该基线的完整 72 阶段单次调用、OCI recipe 重建、CP311 离线安装、Windows/macOS "
"集成和外部示例升级在该记录中仍未执行。边界明确的源码预览版可以保留这些限制。源码／接口变更仍需适用的全新软件检查；旧测试数量不能替代这些检查。"

msgid ""
"Every MCU physical test remains `not_executed`. Board electrical "
"behavior, measured timing/power, Flash power-loss recovery, DMA/cache "
"coherence and physical security isolation need real admitted station "
"records. Applications, private PCB facts, safety outputs, recovery "
"policy, certification and product acceptance remain external "
"responsibilities. This developer preview establishes no product safety "
"certification, signed product qualification or LTS commitment. See "
"[physical status](hardware.md) and the [software/physical qualification "
"contract](../reference/platforms/qualification.md)."
msgstr ""
"每项 MCU 实板测试仍为 `not_executed`。Board 电气行为、实测时序／功耗、Flash 掉电恢复、DMA／Cache "
"一致性和物理安全隔离都需要真实且通过准入的 station 记录。应用、私有 PCB "
"事实、安全输出、恢复策略、认证和产品验收仍由外部工程负责。本开发者预览版不建立产品安全认证、签名产品资格或 LTS "
"承诺。详见[实板状态](hardware.md)和[软件／物理资格合同](../reference/platforms/qualification.md)。"
